---
layout: base.njk
title: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital — NABH Accredited Hospital in Ahmedabad"
description: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad — NABH accredited, 15+ specialties, 24/7 emergency & ICU. Joint replacement, cardiology, neurosurgery, oncology. 100,000+ patients treated. Book appointment now."
keywords: "multispecialty hospital Ahmedabad, NABH hospital Ahmedabad, orthopedic hospital Ahmedabad, knee replacement Ahmedabad, DHS Hospital, emergency hospital Gurukul Ahmedabad"
canonical: "https://www.dhshospitals.com/"
og_title: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital — NABH Accredited Hospital in Ahmedabad"
og_description: "NABH accredited multispecialty hospital in Ahmedabad with 15+ specialties, 24/7 emergency care, and 100,000+ patients treated."
activePage: "home"
extra_head: true
preload_hero: true
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h1>
      <p>{{ site.tagline }}. NABH accredited multispecialty hospital in Ahmedabad offering 15+ specialties with state-of-the-art infrastructure, 24/7 emergency care, and a dedicated team of expert doctors.</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent">Book Appointment</a>
        <a href="/departments/" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:#fff;color:#fff">Our Departments</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      {% for stat in site.stats %}
      <div class="stat-item">
        <div class="stat-value">{{ stat.value }}</div>
        <div class="stat-label">{{ stat.label }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<a href="{{ site.google_reviews_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-trust-strip">
  <span class="gts-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
  <span class="gts-rating"><strong>4.9</strong> Rating</span>
  <span class="gts-sep">&middot;</span>
  <span class="gts-count">2,000+ Google Reviews</span>
  <span class="gts-sep">&middot;</span>
  <span class="gts-cta">View on Google &rarr;</span>
</a>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-section">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/about/dhs-about.jpg" alt="DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <div class="welcome">WELCOME TO</div>
        <h2>DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h2>
        <p>Welcome to DHS Multispecialty Hospital, your trusted hospital partner in Ahmedabad. DHS Multispecialty Hospital is a state-of-the-art advanced multispecialty hospital located in Vastrapur. DHS is a one-stop solution for secondary and tertiary care providing medical and surgical treatments with fully equipped 50 beds, 24x7 ICU & Emergency services.</p>
        <p>After 5+ years of providing comprehensive medical services, DHS hospital proudly stands out for its cutting-edge infrastructure and personalised treatment. Having treated 25,000+ indoor and 100,000+ outdoor patients, we have carved a niche among hospitals in Ahmedabad.</p>
        <p>DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers Mediclaim & Cashless services from major insurance companies for patient's ease.</p>
        <div class="nabh-badge">NABH Accredited Hospital</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Hospital Facilities</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Apart from clinical departments, DHS Multispecialty Hospital has many critical and crucial supportive facilities ensuring prompt and quality patient care.</p>
    <div class="facilities-grid">
      {% for facility in facilities %}
      <div class="facility-card">
        <img src="{{ facility.icon }}" alt="{{ facility.name }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50">
        <h3>{{ facility.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ facility.description }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary-light),#fff)">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:30px;align-items:center" class="velys-hero">
      <div>
        <div style="display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:10px">NEW IN AHMEDABAD</div>
        <h2 style="color:var(--primary);font-size:1.9rem;margin-bottom:12px">VELYS Robotic Knee Replacement</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7">DHS Multispecialty Hospital performs <strong>VELYS robotic-assisted knee replacement</strong> from Johnson &amp; Johnson DePuy Synthes — an imageless platform with <strong>no pre-op CT</strong>, sub-millimetre accuracy, and the proven J&amp;J Attune knee implant. Led by Dr. Hardik Shah (FRCS Germany) and Dr. Swagat Shah (FIAAS UK).</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <div><strong style="color:var(--primary);font-size:1.4rem">98%</strong><div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-light)">alignment accuracy</div></div>
          <div><strong style="color:var(--primary);font-size:1.4rem">15,000+</strong><div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-light)">knee surgeries</div></div>
          <div><strong style="color:var(--primary);font-size:1.4rem">₹3.5–5L</strong><div style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--text-light)">cashless available</div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:18px">
          <a href="/velys-robotic-knee-replacement-ahmedabad/" class="btn btn-primary">Learn About VELYS</a>
          <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-left:8px">Book Consultation</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/assets/images/client/joint-bg.jpg" alt="VELYS robotic knee replacement at DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" style="border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>@media(max-width:768px){.velys-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}}</style>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Departments</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Our hospital is accredited by NABH, reflecting our dedication to quality, safety, and continuous improvement.</p>
    <div class="dept-grid">
      {% for dept in departments | head(8) %}
      <div class="dept-card">
        <img src="{{ dept.image }}" alt="{{ dept.name }} department at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="180">
        <div class="dept-card-body">
          <h3>{{ dept.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ dept.short_desc }}</p>
          <a href="/departments/{{ dept.slug }}/" class="btn btn-outline" style="font-size:.8rem;padding:6px 16px">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/departments/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Departments</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Doctors</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Meet our team of experienced and dedicated medical professionals.</p>
    <div class="doctors-grid">
      {% for doc in doctors | head(4) %}
      <div class="doctor-card">
        <img src="{{ doc.image }}" alt="{{ doc.name }} — {{ doc.specialty }} at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad" loading="lazy" width="300" height="250">
        <div class="doctor-card-body">
          <h3>{{ doc.name }}</h3>
          <div class="qualification">{{ doc.qualification }}</div>
          <div class="specialty">{{ doc.specialty }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px">
      <a href="/doctors/" class="btn btn-primary">View All Doctors</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Patient Testimonials</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">What our patients say about their experience at DHS Multispecialty Hospital.</p>
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      {% for review in reviews %}
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p>"{{ review.text }}"</p>
        <div class="source">— {{ review.source }} Review</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <a href="{{ site.google_reviews_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-review-badge">
      <div class="grb-logo">G</div>
      <div class="grb-info">
        <div class="grb-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <strong>4.9</strong></div>
        <div class="grb-text">Based on 2,000+ Google Reviews</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grb-cta">View Reviews &rarr;</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section faq-section" style="background:var(--bg-light)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about DHS Multispecialty Hospital.</p>
    {% for section in faq %}
    <h3 class="faq-category">{{ section.category }}</h3>
    {% for item in section.items %}
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">{{ item.a }}</div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="background:var(--primary);color:#fff;text-align:center">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:15px">Need Medical Assistance?</h2>
    <p style="opacity:.9;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 25px">Our team of expert doctors is available 24/7 for emergencies. Book an appointment or call us now.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:15px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-accent">Book Appointment</a>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.emergency }}" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--primary)">Call: {{ site.phones.emergency }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
